X: 1
T: the Goddesses
P: Longways for as many as will
%R: Rreel
B: "The Compleat Country Dancing-Master" printed by John Walsh, London ca. 1740
S: 6: CCDM1 http://imslp.org/wiki/The_Compleat_Country_Dancing-Master_(Various) V.1 p.85 #121 (169)
Z: 2013 John Chambers <jc:trillian.mit.edu>
N: The rhythm isn't right between the two strains.
N: The dance is in 11 sections, and two columns; the columns aren't transcribed here.
M: C|
L: 1/8
K: Gdor
